<title>GERMANY: Buba says Bobl 120 topped up by three billion dmk.</title>
<headline>Buba says Bobl 120 topped up by three billion dmk.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume on the series 120 Bundesobligation (Bobl) federal treasury bond has been topped up by three billion marks to a total of 12 billion marks, Germany's Bundesbank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The extra volume will be used by the central bank in its open market operations from January 20, the Bundesbank said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
